# S2, member a (k10): with b through the lobby gate (a co-arrival), west across stag0101, out by matz02 alone (a
# fork: b stays); b follows later and joins by catch-up; both go back through stag0102's matz01 together.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west}
log at the exit
wander -310 -190 8 until sealed>=7000
log a leaves alone
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102 alone
wander 330 140 15 until present=2,sealed>=300
log b joined
wander 330 140 15 until sealed>=900
mat matz01 yes 2 until stage=stag0101,control
log together back in stag0101
wander -310 -170 15 until sealed>=2400
log enough
idle until frames>=60
